WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.922
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:10.192 --> 00:11.258
Trust me, please.

3
00:11.790 --> 00:13.300
Everything will be fine.

4
00:13.495 --> 00:14.676
If you want me to stay,

5
00:14.776 --> 00:16.123
I'm happy to stay.

6
00:16.516 --> 00:17.365
Don't go anywhere.

7
00:17.709 --> 00:18.677
Will you be my boyfriend?

8
00:18.702 --> 00:20.700
I will, I will be your boyfriend.

9
00:20.966 --> 00:25.100
I guess painless love does exist.

10
00:27.733 --> 00:29.133
Tee, your phone.

11
00:29.819 --> 00:31.586
Can you check who it is?

12
00:35.892 --> 00:37.892
(Tee.)

13
00:38.187 --> 00:40.435
(Where are you?)

14
00:40.754 --> 00:42.754
(I really want to see you.)

15
00:42.823 --> 00:44.823
(I can't take it anymore.)

16
00:44.893 --> 00:46.893
(Can you come back to me?)

17
02:28.259 --> 02:29.312
"I really want to see you."

18
02:29.612 --> 02:30.745
"Can you come back to me?"

19
02:31.639 --> 02:32.439
Ugh.

20
02:32.657 --> 02:34.557
Tee, are you sneaking around with someone else?

21
02:34.805 --> 02:36.305
Why do people keep going back to their ex?

22
02:36.572 --> 02:37.905
You said you liked me, didn't you?

23
02:41.698 --> 02:42.978
What’s wrong, Fuse?

24
02:44.904 --> 02:48.071
Did my brother do something to upset you?

25
02:48.838 --> 02:49.705
Let me know.

26
02:51.505 --> 02:52.639
I’ll deal with him.

27
02:58.539 --> 02:59.992
Where are you going next?

28
03:02.105 --> 03:03.358
Going…

29
03:04.705 --> 03:05.639
Where to?

30
03:07.039 --> 03:07.839
Oh.

31
03:08.905 --> 03:09.939
You came here this early.

32
03:11.158 --> 03:12.658
Didn't you make a plan with him?

33
03:15.418 --> 03:16.830
Ah.

34
03:18.791 --> 03:19.591
Yes.

35
03:23.572 --> 03:25.305
How have you been?

36
03:26.839 --> 03:27.772
How is your class going?

37
03:29.839 --> 03:30.639
Um.

38
03:31.739 --> 03:32.739
Not bad.

39
03:34.805 --> 03:38.105
Tee came to ask me for advice the other day.

40
03:40.772 --> 03:43.339
He told me he failed one subject.

41
03:44.405 --> 03:46.239
How could someone like him fail the exam?

42
03:48.939 --> 03:50.323
He also told me…

43
03:51.501 --> 03:54.333
it's the subject that he loves the most.

44
03:57.917 --> 04:02.305
Seems like he misunderstood everything.

45
04:05.705 --> 04:07.025
But I think…

46
04:09.234 --> 04:12.610
he's trying to retake an exam.

47
04:18.139 --> 04:21.139
Do you think Tee will pass the exam this time?

48
04:24.905 --> 04:26.739
I think it depends on Tee.

49
04:28.611 --> 04:30.511
Whether he genuinely wants to pass this exam…

50
04:33.378 --> 04:36.952
or wants to take another exam instead.

51
04:53.250 --> 04:55.139
When did you come down? You didn't tell me.

52
04:58.445 --> 04:59.545
Thank you for the meal.

53
05:11.625 --> 05:12.399
Tim.

54
05:13.442 --> 05:14.772
What did you do to my person?

55
05:16.005 --> 05:17.605
You shouldn't be asking me.

56
05:18.551 --> 05:20.218
You should ask your own person.

57
05:21.965 --> 05:22.765
Hey.

58
05:23.531 --> 05:24.831
What are you waiting for?

59
05:25.658 --> 05:26.758
Go make it up to him.

60
05:27.285 --> 05:28.685
Otherwise, you'll fail the exam again.

61
05:30.851 --> 05:31.804
No way.

62
05:32.680 --> 05:35.291
I must get A+ this time.

63
05:47.372 --> 05:49.957
Tee, you're pursuing me.

64
05:49.957 --> 05:51.905
How could you manage to talk to your ex?

65
05:55.143 --> 05:56.305
(Tee, where are you?)

66
05:56.330 --> 05:57.225
(I really want to see you.)

67
05:57.250 --> 05:58.551
(I can't take it anymore.)

68
05:58.576 --> 06:01.430
(Can you come back to me?)

69
06:24.723 --> 06:25.523
Jeez.

70
06:38.843 --> 06:39.910
What are you guys doing?

71
06:39.910 --> 06:42.610
I'm with my babe. Let me hold it for you, babe. I gotta go.

72
06:42.610 --> 06:43.623
Mo.

73
06:44.063 --> 06:45.763
I'm pooping. Let me hang up first.

74
06:45.763 --> 06:47.130
Frame.

75
06:47.566 --> 06:50.218
We're here for the makeup exam. The teacher just called us, we've to go.

76
06:51.103 --> 06:51.903
Hey

77
06:53.796 --> 06:54.596
Hey.

78
06:56.796 --> 06:57.596
Ugh.

79
07:00.196 --> 07:01.196
No one is free to call me.

80
07:12.430 --> 07:15.296
What's wrong? Why did you eat so little today?

81
07:27.570 --> 07:28.070
Oh.

82
07:36.649 --> 07:38.165
Do you want something else to eat?

83
07:38.629 --> 07:39.518
Like me?

84
07:51.630 --> 07:52.730
Won't you play along?

85
07:55.796 --> 07:57.596
Why did you call your friends earlier?

86
07:59.210 --> 08:00.810
You don’t want to be with me anymore?

87
08:03.630 --> 08:04.430
I’m the one who should have said that.

88
08:06.963 --> 08:07.763
What?

89
08:13.163 --> 08:14.296
Have you replied her yet?

90
08:16.730 --> 08:17.530
Reply to whom?

91
08:17.830 --> 08:20.430
Or did you guys secretly talk to each other without telling me?

92
08:21.096 --> 08:21.896
Huh?

93
08:23.096 --> 08:23.896
What do you mean?

94
08:24.830 --> 08:27.202
Tee, look into my eyes.

95
08:28.528 --> 08:30.730
They say liars avoid eye contact.

96
08:36.730 --> 08:37.530
Who told you that?

97
08:38.563 --> 08:39.396
Tee.

98
08:45.696 --> 08:46.996
I won't avoid your gaze.

99
08:47.963 --> 08:49.196
And I'll hold you in my arms as well.

100
08:53.363 --> 08:55.630
Why are you sulking? Talk to me.

101
08:58.496 --> 08:59.896
Your ex.

102
09:01.563 --> 09:02.363
My ex?

103
09:05.163 --> 09:06.196
Check your chat.

104
09:14.436 --> 09:17.876
(If you don't reply, I'll call you.)

105
09:32.030 --> 09:32.830
Hello?

106
09:33.423 --> 09:37.984
Where are you? Can you come over here?

107
09:38.069 --> 09:39.596
I want to see you.

108
09:40.196 --> 09:41.763
I'm busy right now.

109
09:42.340 --> 09:48.018
Even you don't care about me? Why is the world so mean to me?

110
09:48.158 --> 09:50.845
If you don't show up, I'll end my life.

111
09:51.259 --> 09:52.440
(Fuse) End her life? (Tee) End her life?

112
09:54.024 --> 09:57.416
Hurry up, I'm waiting at our usual place.

113
10:06.372 --> 10:07.706
Why are you making that face?

114
10:09.172 --> 10:10.472
I brought you along with me.

115
10:11.172 --> 10:12.206
Are you still overthinking?

116
10:15.106 --> 10:16.676
You still haven't told me…

117
10:16.676 --> 10:18.172
who Baikhao is.

118
10:20.672 --> 10:22.135
Baikhao is my ex.

119
10:22.239 --> 10:23.142
Well, I'm off.

120
10:23.445 --> 10:24.245
Hey.

121
10:26.971 --> 10:28.272
We broke up a long time ago.

122
10:29.206 --> 10:30.406
We're really just friends right now.

123
10:31.798 --> 10:32.598
You sure?

124
10:33.618 --> 10:34.411
Absolutely.

125
10:35.439 --> 10:36.872
That's why I brought you along.

126
10:37.706 --> 10:39.306
So you don't have to overthink it on your own.

127
10:40.606 --> 10:41.506
And you'll know that…

128
10:42.039 --> 10:43.372
You're the only one I love.

129
10:49.106 --> 10:50.106
Fine, let's head over.

130
10:50.906 --> 10:52.192
I wonder if she's okay by now.

131
10:52.798 --> 10:53.598
Come on.

132
10:59.039 --> 10:59.839
Tee.

133
11:00.052 --> 11:01.311
I really miss you.

134
11:03.611 --> 11:04.511
This one is good.

135
11:04.918 --> 11:05.785
You should try some.

136
11:08.019 --> 11:08.819
Hey.

137
11:21.785 --> 11:22.629
This is Fuse.

138
11:23.221 --> 11:23.899
My friend.

139
11:25.382 --> 11:26.222
This is Baikhao.

140
11:29.015 --> 11:29.658
Hi.

141
11:32.039 --> 11:33.606
Is he your new friend?

142
11:34.272 --> 11:35.406
I've never seen him before.

143
11:36.552 --> 11:38.319
He seems a bit rude.

144
11:39.725 --> 11:42.892
I normally see you hanging around with Champ and Copter.

145
11:44.012 --> 11:46.496
I've been closest to him lately.

146
11:48.232 --> 11:49.032
Oh, really?

147
11:50.425 --> 11:51.659
How envious.

148
11:56.212 --> 11:58.055
How are you doing?

149
11:59.035 --> 12:00.072
About what you tell me.

150
12:00.512 --> 12:03.145
About I'm going to end my life?

151
12:04.471 --> 12:05.271
Huh.

152
12:05.505 --> 12:06.905
I'm not going to die easily.

153
12:07.206 --> 12:08.506
As long as she's still breathing,

154
12:08.685 --> 12:10.025
I refuse to die.

155
12:11.545 --> 12:12.412
Who are you talking about?

156
12:13.006 --> 12:15.206
The person who Babe liked her post.

157
12:15.605 --> 12:17.172
It's driving me crazy.

158
12:17.465 --> 12:19.672
There are millions of profiles on IG,

159
12:19.972 --> 12:21.406
And yet he chose to like her post.

160
12:21.785 --> 12:23.185
I already told Babe that…

161
12:23.298 --> 12:24.498
If this happens one more time,

162
12:24.572 --> 12:25.618
we're done.

163
12:25.780 --> 12:26.771
Mark my words.

164
12:29.666 --> 12:31.725
I'm done for real this time.

165
12:32.164 --> 12:34.137
Am I not good enough?

166
12:34.162 --> 12:36.847
Why did he have to like her post?

167
12:36.891 --> 12:37.653
Baikhao, chill out.

168
12:37.853 --> 12:38.946
Have you talked to you boyfriend?

169
12:39.218 --> 12:40.472
He might have misclicked.

170
12:41.885 --> 12:43.092
No, I won't talk to him.

171
12:43.117 --> 12:45.518
I already blocked him and I'll throw my phone away.

172
12:45.543 --> 12:46.561
Wait, wait.

173
12:48.581 --> 12:49.192
Chill out.

174
12:49.217 --> 12:50.017
Take it easy.

175
12:55.172 --> 12:56.906
Did someone say my name?

176
13:04.771 --> 13:05.749
Babe.

177
13:07.439 --> 13:08.946
I'm sorry.

178
13:10.406 --> 13:11.572
You've got it wrong.

179
13:12.372 --> 13:13.439
Hear me out, please.

180
13:13.839 --> 13:16.006
Why didn't you tell me in the first place?

181
13:16.850 --> 13:18.743
You blocked me.

182
13:19.949 --> 13:21.883
Let's head back. I want to go home.

183
13:22.050 --> 13:23.350
Okay.

184
13:36.976 --> 13:38.443
What just happened?

185
13:39.682 --> 13:41.216
Well, it’s Baikhao and her boyfriend.

186
13:42.283 --> 13:43.532
I already knew that.

187
13:43.938 --> 13:45.196
Are you messing with me?

188
13:45.416 --> 13:46.950
She is usually like this.

189
13:46.975 --> 13:47.841
Always arguing with her boyfriend.

190
13:48.722 --> 13:50.322
But they actually love each other.

191
13:51.325 --> 13:52.572
She's fighting with her boyfriend,

192
13:52.597 --> 13:53.810
and yet she calls you?

193
13:54.716 --> 13:55.528
Why?

194
13:56.348 --> 13:57.083
Are you jealous?

195
13:58.642 --> 13:59.372
No.

196
14:00.783 --> 14:02.749
I'm just asking.

197
14:03.683 --> 14:06.932
So that means I can meet her again in the future?

198
14:08.070 --> 14:09.025
Tee.

199
14:10.283 --> 14:11.372
I'm kidding.

200
14:12.802 --> 14:14.669
Baikhao and I are just friends.

201
14:15.816 --> 14:17.616
Can you really be friends with an ex?

202
14:18.883 --> 14:20.283
I can be friends with everyone…

203
14:21.816 --> 14:22.683
except one person.

204
14:24.116 --> 14:24.916
Who?

205
14:25.776 --> 14:26.992
It's you.

206
14:27.422 --> 14:28.632
Are you gonna cutting me off?

207
14:28.657 --> 14:29.697
Are you stupid?

208
14:29.923 --> 14:30.516
Huh?

209
14:30.883 --> 14:31.683
What did you say?

210
14:32.516 --> 14:33.516
Nothing.

211
14:34.757 --> 14:36.465
If it bothers you, I can block her.

212
14:36.816 --> 14:37.638
It's okay.

213
14:38.592 --> 14:39.294
Tee, you don't have to.

214
14:40.373 --> 14:41.504
She's your friend.

215
14:42.371 --> 14:43.514
I'm also your friend.

216
14:44.276 --> 14:45.305
It's not my place to to stop you.

217
14:50.822 --> 14:51.622
You can.

218
14:55.809 --> 14:57.009
Who am I to to stop you?

219
15:14.493 --> 15:15.260
What’s up, bro?

220
15:16.029 --> 15:16.958
Hey, Fuse.

221
15:17.047 --> 15:18.277
Let's go on a trip.

222
15:18.302 --> 15:20.556
Wit's resort will cover everything.

223
15:20.589 --> 15:22.214
Free food and accommodation.

224
15:22.214 --> 15:23.776
Super chill.

225
15:24.421 --> 15:25.960
Hey, it’s not like that.

226
15:26.807 --> 15:29.531
Cool, I'm in.

227
15:29.953 --> 15:31.453
Great, see you at school tomorrow.

228
15:31.478 --> 15:34.260
Whoa, let's go.

229
15:35.306 --> 15:36.106
Tomorrow?

230
15:36.952 --> 15:37.752
Hello?

231
15:38.053 --> 15:38.853
Hello? Hello?

232
15:39.260 --> 15:40.093
Leaving tomorrow?

233
15:42.970 --> 15:44.337
Will you go on a trip with me?

234
15:46.553 --> 15:47.353
Sure.

235
15:59.453 --> 16:03.446
Let's go.

236
16:04.162 --> 16:06.162
Let's go on a trip.

237
16:09.589 --> 16:10.930
What's up, bro?

238
16:10.955 --> 16:12.852
Yay, bro.

239
16:12.912 --> 16:14.785
Wit's driver is here, let's go.

240
16:16.355 --> 16:17.188
Let's go.

241
16:19.278 --> 16:20.122
Come on.

242
16:20.769 --> 16:21.569
Let’s go.

243
16:22.508 --> 16:23.775
Tee, you go ahead.

244
16:24.136 --> 16:25.102
I need to pee.

245
16:25.752 --> 16:27.295
Give me your bag. I'll carry it.

246
16:28.388 --> 16:29.188
Thanks.

247
16:33.028 --> 16:33.862
Hurry up.

248
16:34.269 --> 16:35.069
Mo.

249
16:39.555 --> 16:40.355
What?

250
16:43.136 --> 16:44.636
Can I ask your advice on something?

251
16:45.922 --> 16:46.722
Go ahead.

252
16:50.822 --> 16:52.995
I've been thinking…

253
16:55.141 --> 16:56.488
I think…

254
16:59.788 --> 17:00.588
I think…

255
17:00.725 --> 17:01.722
Hey.

256
17:02.681 --> 17:03.648
By the time you say it,

257
17:04.042 --> 17:05.475
I'll already be at Khao Yai.

258
17:06.189 --> 17:06.989
Fine.

259
17:07.609 --> 17:08.442
I'll talk.

260
17:11.122 --> 17:12.256
On this trip,

261
17:13.693 --> 17:14.443
I think…

262
17:15.272 --> 17:17.015
I'lll ask Tee to be my boyfriend.

263
17:18.242 --> 17:19.809
Go for it, I'll help you.

264
17:21.588 --> 17:22.388
Really?

265
17:22.941 --> 17:26.741
Yeah, trust me on this.

266
17:28.815 --> 17:29.615
You sure?

267
17:29.962 --> 17:30.796
Wanna go?

268
17:31.555 --> 17:33.122
Alright, let's go.

269
17:33.762 --> 17:35.575
Let's go.

270
17:36.122 --> 17:37.188
Can I really trust you?

271
17:53.688 --> 17:55.155
It’s better than it does in the pictures.

272
17:55.222 --> 17:55.722
Seriously?

273
17:55.722 --> 17:56.288
Yeah.

274
17:56.288 --> 17:57.088
It's pretty.

275
17:57.315 --> 17:58.315
Right, I feel like going in the water.

276
17:58.361 --> 17:59.308
Who's coming with me?

277
17:59.328 --> 18:00.129
Is there a place for swimming?

278
18:00.154 --> 18:00.722
There is.

279
18:00.722 --> 18:02.187
Hey, I think we should try it this afternoon.

280
18:02.387 --> 18:02.887
You down?

281
18:02.972 --> 18:03.472
I'm down.

282
18:03.680 --> 18:04.672
Me too.

283
18:04.697 --> 18:06.105
Me too.

284
18:06.130 --> 18:07.652
Right.

285
18:10.185 --> 18:12.345
Fuse, do you think this place looks familiar?

286
18:12.625 --> 18:13.861
We have been here before, right?

287
18:15.347 --> 18:17.318
Um, I think you're right.

288
18:17.547 --> 18:18.564
Shoot.

289
18:19.135 --> 18:20.038
Wow, Wit.

290
18:20.366 --> 18:23.692
Your resort is amazing.

291
18:24.481 --> 18:25.281
Whoa.

292
18:26.701 --> 18:27.501
Ouch.

293
18:27.781 --> 18:29.085
Wit.

294
18:29.400 --> 18:30.200
Whoa.

295
18:31.545 --> 18:32.345
Alright.

296
18:32.892 --> 18:34.978
Stay here. I'll be right back.

297
18:35.098 --> 18:35.458
Hurry up.

298
18:35.483 --> 18:36.338
Fine.

299
18:36.545 --> 18:37.378
Make it quick.

300
18:43.945 --> 18:44.778
Who texted you?

301
18:46.911 --> 18:47.711
My sibling.

302
18:49.431 --> 18:50.398
Men or women?

303
18:51.345 --> 18:52.211
Women.

304
18:56.484 --> 18:57.384
She's my older sister.

305
18:57.811 --> 18:58.611
Real older sister.

306
18:59.332 --> 19:00.932
She looks like me in a wig.

307
19:01.378 --> 19:02.311
You in a wig?

308
19:02.845 --> 19:04.178
I want to see you in a wig.

309
19:05.045 --> 19:07.211
Then pulling off the wig of the person next to you.

310
19:07.445 --> 19:07.945
Hey.

311
19:07.945 --> 19:08.492
Whoa, easy.

312
19:08.492 --> 19:09.511
This is my real hair.

313
19:09.632 --> 19:10.298
I'm joking.

314
19:10.411 --> 19:11.345
I just think you're cute.

315
19:11.791 --> 19:12.625
Hey, hey.

316
19:12.650 --> 19:13.450
Hey, hey.

317
19:21.211 --> 19:22.804
Look, do we look alike?

318
19:25.485 --> 19:27.318
Are you still talking with those people?

319
19:28.084 --> 19:28.884
Those people?

320
19:29.991 --> 19:31.779
You told me you have a lot of options.

321
19:31.860 --> 19:32.938
Nah.

322
19:33.292 --> 19:34.292
I already have my boyfriend.

323
19:34.839 --> 19:35.718
I've cut ties with all of them.

324
19:40.178 --> 19:40.978
If you don't trust me,

325
19:41.311 --> 19:42.645
you can check my phone.

326
19:42.778 --> 19:43.845
I'll give you my password.

327
19:45.378 --> 19:46.178
No.

328
19:47.578 --> 19:49.112
I don't want to know your password at all.

329
19:50.171 --> 19:51.571
I just want to trust you.

330
19:52.725 --> 19:54.091
You can trust me.

331
19:55.745 --> 19:56.245
Because…

332
19:56.973 --> 19:58.072
I truly have only you.

333
19:59.692 --> 20:02.889
My wife is the sexiest in the world.

334
20:03.527 --> 20:05.345
Especially when…

335
20:05.345 --> 20:06.472
When?

336
20:06.472 --> 20:08.452
You don't have to know that.

337
20:10.411 --> 20:11.618
How about you, Fuse?

338
20:11.913 --> 20:13.134
Other couples is so in love,

339
20:13.134 --> 20:14.111
leaving only you.

340
20:15.845 --> 20:17.045
I'm also happy.

341
20:17.345 --> 20:18.378
Happy? You sure?

342
20:18.911 --> 20:19.855
Great. I'm leaving then.

343
20:19.855 --> 20:20.378
Hey.

344
20:21.778 --> 20:22.845
I thought you would help me.

345
20:25.345 --> 20:26.145
Hey.

346
20:26.445 --> 20:28.011
Listen up, kid.

347
20:28.945 --> 20:29.745
I guarantee you.

348
20:30.145 --> 20:31.378
After this trip,

349
20:31.778 --> 20:33.111
you'll have a boyfriend.

350
20:39.045 --> 20:40.211
What will you do?

351
20:41.111 --> 20:42.011
Just trust me.

352
20:48.245 --> 20:49.045
Guys.

353
20:49.412 --> 20:49.936
I'm back.

354
20:50.145 --> 20:50.987
Wit.

355
20:51.012 --> 20:52.245
How many rooms did you book?

356
20:52.378 --> 20:53.645
Hey, I want a big one.

357
20:53.845 --> 20:54.645
I want a bathtub.

358
20:54.845 --> 20:56.111
I want a room with a mountain view.

359
20:56.145 --> 20:57.386
I want a soundproof room.

360
20:57.411 --> 20:58.553
Frame.

361
20:58.578 --> 20:59.898
I just want to play some music.

362
21:00.285 --> 21:01.705
Uh, guys…

363
21:02.378 --> 21:03.745
I saw that you guys were coming.

364
21:04.045 --> 21:05.245
So I told my dad…

365
21:05.511 --> 21:06.611
I wanted to go camping.

366
21:06.636 --> 21:08.196
Camping?

367
21:15.511 --> 21:17.111
That’s a huge pile of dog poop.

368
21:27.145 --> 21:29.311
Hey, will you go camping with me?

369
21:32.138 --> 21:32.938
Let's go.

370
21:33.245 --> 21:36.211
Hold on, you have to crawl out quietly.

371
21:36.378 --> 21:36.878
Why?

372
21:37.173 --> 21:38.311
There is the enemy.

373
21:39.045 --> 21:41.811
Yeah, they might take us down.

374
21:48.388 --> 21:49.912
Come here.

375
21:50.014 --> 21:51.158
Come on.

376
21:51.321 --> 21:52.155
Let's have some pizza.

377
21:52.212 --> 21:53.081
Let's eat.

378
21:53.615 --> 21:55.115
Are gonna finish a whole pizza?

379
21:57.621 --> 21:58.421
Hey.

380
21:58.850 --> 21:59.892
Mo.

381
22:00.273 --> 22:01.965
The day is almost over.

382
22:02.238 --> 22:03.781
I still haven't asked him to be my boyfriend yet.

383
22:06.661 --> 22:07.594
It's okay.

384
22:07.868 --> 22:08.792
Trust me.

385
22:09.381 --> 22:10.281
Leave it to me.

386
22:10.948 --> 22:11.710
Wit.

387
22:11.710 --> 22:12.210
Huh?

388
22:12.348 --> 22:13.381
What's that over there?

389
22:13.675 --> 22:14.542
Why is it so dark?

390
22:22.581 --> 22:23.381
Over there?

391
22:29.481 --> 22:30.681
A murder took place right there.

392
22:31.115 --> 22:31.915
Gosh!

393
22:33.447 --> 22:35.481
Are you scared?

394
22:36.722 --> 22:37.522
I'm not.

395
22:38.608 --> 22:40.131
Wit, tell us the story.

396
22:40.681 --> 22:42.485
Fuse.

397
22:47.215 --> 22:48.014
Alright.

398
22:49.504 --> 22:51.079
I only know the rough details…

399
22:52.405 --> 22:54.578
since it happened before I was born.

400
22:58.181 --> 23:01.334
At that time, two guests came to stay.

401
23:02.368 --> 23:03.757
A woman and a man.

402
23:05.279 --> 23:06.607
But when checking out,

403
23:09.175 --> 23:10.792
there were only a man checking out.

404
23:11.379 --> 23:12.446
The housekeeper…

405
23:13.585 --> 23:15.538
bent down to clean under the bench,

406
23:16.612 --> 23:17.579
she saw…

407
23:22.919 --> 23:23.713
a dust.

408
23:23.773 --> 23:24.273
Gosh!

409
23:25.159 --> 23:26.726
Ugh.

410
23:26.733 --> 23:27.799
Wit.

411
23:28.146 --> 23:28.892
Alright.

412
23:31.719 --> 23:33.419
The body of that woman…

413
23:37.392 --> 23:38.732
was drenched in blood.

414
23:38.757 --> 23:40.430
Oh.

415
23:41.599 --> 23:42.665
After that incident,

416
23:44.058 --> 23:45.292
some guests who stayed here…

417
23:48.998 --> 23:50.146
said that…

418
23:52.759 --> 23:54.065
they heard a women laughing…

419
23:55.471 --> 23:56.945
and crying.

420
24:00.389 --> 24:01.523
But some of them…

421
24:05.090 --> 24:06.323
saw the woman sitting on the bench.

422
24:13.090 --> 24:17.490
My dad had to invite a monk for chanting,

423
24:19.690 --> 24:21.156
but it didn't hep at all.

424
24:22.456 --> 24:25.418
So he decided to leave that bench…

425
24:26.203 --> 24:27.141
in a storage.

426
24:31.956 --> 24:33.990
And nobody dared to touch it ever again.

427
24:39.696 --> 24:40.863
That's the story.

428
24:53.269 --> 24:55.469
Let's do a test.

429
24:56.390 --> 24:57.190
A test?

430
24:57.723 --> 24:58.956
A test of courage.

431
24:59.690 --> 25:02.256
Whoever brave enough to take a selfie with the bench,

432
25:02.656 --> 25:04.390
I'll carry your bag all day tomorrow.

433
25:05.323 --> 25:06.718
Ugh.

434
25:07.156 --> 25:07.956
Save it.

435
25:08.230 --> 25:09.797
I can carry my wife’s bag.

436
25:10.309 --> 25:11.109
Frame.

437
25:11.890 --> 25:14.038
I told you not to call me as a wife.

438
25:16.956 --> 25:19.352
I'm out. It looks so dusty.

439
25:19.618 --> 25:20.722
My skin will break out.

440
25:20.856 --> 25:22.723
I'm out. It's nonsense.

441
25:22.870 --> 25:24.136
I agree with you.

442
25:24.582 --> 25:25.382
Or…

443
25:26.436 --> 25:27.936
are you guys still scared of ghosts?

444
25:28.356 --> 25:29.523
You're in the 11th grade now.

445
25:29.716 --> 25:30.956
I'll do it.

446
25:31.956 --> 25:32.790
Who are you going with?

447
25:33.802 --> 25:34.969
With Tee, obviously.

448
25:36.356 --> 25:37.290
Hey, Fuse.

449
25:38.256 --> 25:40.723
Are you gonna let a 10th grade kid look down on us like this?

450
25:41.590 --> 25:43.356
We need to prove to this kid…

451
25:43.723 --> 25:45.123
that ghosts aren't exist.

452
25:46.290 --> 25:47.456
Only taking a photo, right?

453
25:50.356 --> 25:51.356
Let's go, Tee.

454
25:54.323 --> 25:55.123
You got this.

455
25:57.109 --> 25:58.209
Come on, you can do it.

456
26:15.690 --> 26:16.523
Are you scared?

457
26:17.162 --> 26:17.962
Shall we go back?

458
26:19.090 --> 26:20.756
If you're scared, why did you come?

459
26:22.190 --> 26:22.990
I won't go back.

460
26:24.356 --> 26:25.856
Rodtang will laugh at us.

461
26:27.523 --> 26:28.323
Are you scared?

462
26:31.290 --> 26:32.590
I'm more scared of people.

463
26:33.690 --> 26:35.756
What if there is a robber in here?

464
26:37.123 --> 26:38.090
Give it to me.

465
26:40.056 --> 26:41.156
Stand behind me then.

466
26:48.483 --> 26:51.416
Hold on, I think just a front shot is enough.

467
26:52.642 --> 26:55.142
No way, they're gonna think we're chickens.

468
26:57.216 --> 27:00.583
Let's make it quick and head back.

469
27:18.923 --> 27:19.423
Gosh!

470
27:19.423 --> 27:20.056
Oh!

471
27:20.083 --> 27:21.256
What's that?

472
27:21.429 --> 27:22.443
What's going on?

473
27:22.483 --> 27:23.556
What's that?

474
27:23.581 --> 27:24.509
What's going on?

475
27:24.690 --> 27:25.390
What happened?

476
27:25.390 --> 27:26.890
Tee, what's that?

477
27:27.703 --> 27:28.509
A bowl.

478
27:31.431 --> 27:32.612
It scared me.

479
27:33.641 --> 27:34.791
Oh!

480
27:38.031 --> 27:41.290
A Buddha statue. We apologize.

481
27:46.956 --> 27:48.445
Tee.

482
27:49.925 --> 27:50.947
Is this the bench?

483
27:52.813 --> 27:54.555
The one that had a body under it?

484
27:54.768 --> 27:55.596
Hey.

485
27:56.407 --> 27:57.818
Don't say like that.

486
27:59.782 --> 28:02.140
Alright, let's take a photo and head back.

487
28:14.190 --> 28:15.456
Won't you check the photos?

488
28:15.749 --> 28:17.616
No way, I'm afraid I will spot something else.

489
28:18.569 --> 28:19.933
If you're this scared,

490
28:20.755 --> 28:22.269
you don't have to do it in the first place.

491
28:22.776 --> 28:25.123
Because I'll carry your bag anyway tomorrow.

492
28:28.769 --> 28:30.403
Alright, let's head back.

493
28:35.923 --> 28:36.723
You're not heading back?

494
28:41.723 --> 28:42.856
I came here…

495
28:46.723 --> 28:48.323
just because I wanted to be with you alone.

496
28:52.123 --> 28:54.764
Do you remember that…

497
28:54.764 --> 28:56.790
we're in the same class in middle school?

498
29:00.056 --> 29:01.237
But we weren't close back then.

499
29:01.437 --> 29:02.290
Fuse.

500
29:02.983 --> 29:03.783
What are you doing?

501
29:03.837 --> 29:05.803
I'm solving the math homework that is due today.

502
29:06.323 --> 29:07.856
But in high school,

503
29:09.556 --> 29:10.990
we became close out of nowhere.

504
29:21.010 --> 29:23.043
I'm so glad we got close.

505
29:28.123 --> 29:30.775
You're always be by my side whenever I'm in trouble.

506
29:32.739 --> 29:34.170
Even though I make you cry,

507
29:35.161 --> 29:36.317
you never walk away.

508
29:38.321 --> 29:40.006
Thank you.

509
29:40.939 --> 29:44.155
And I'm sorry for making you sad.

510
29:52.690 --> 29:55.661
But I won't let it happen again.

511
29:56.594 --> 29:59.849
I'll care you the way you care me.

512
30:00.956 --> 30:03.890
I'll understand you the way you understand me.

513
30:05.356 --> 30:08.323
I'll take care of you the way you take care of me.

514
30:10.523 --> 30:13.356
I will never hurt you.

515
30:18.810 --> 30:20.810
Because I don't want to lose you again.

516
30:25.390 --> 30:26.226
Tee.

517
30:28.056 --> 30:30.067
Do you think…

518
30:30.067 --> 30:32.300
we'll be together forever from now on?

519
30:36.575 --> 30:37.842
Not as a friend.

520
30:42.990 --> 30:43.890
But as a…

521
30:48.043 --> 30:48.843
What?

522
30:49.176 --> 30:49.976
Oh.

523
30:50.556 --> 30:51.356
Oh!

524
30:54.323 --> 30:55.123
Tee.

525
30:55.682 --> 30:56.482
What's this?

526
31:00.336 --> 31:01.136
Fuse.

527
31:06.090 --> 31:08.090
A lot has happened recently.

528
31:10.836 --> 31:12.103
It made me sad sometimes.

529
31:13.323 --> 31:15.856
Fuse, I bought a cake for you.

530
31:19.356 --> 31:20.956
And every good thing in your life,

531
31:21.690 --> 31:22.790
you'd better keep it for yourself.

532
31:23.523 --> 31:25.090
Can we go back to be friends?

533
31:27.856 --> 31:28.923
Believe it or not,

534
31:30.756 --> 31:32.290
I've never stopped loving you.

535
31:38.556 --> 31:39.759
I'm so grateful for everything that…

536
31:41.526 --> 31:43.699
brought me to a cutie like you.

537
31:44.681 --> 31:45.655
You know what,

538
31:47.079 --> 31:48.490
I like you from the first day.

539
31:50.723 --> 31:52.156
When we got close,

540
31:52.756 --> 31:53.956
I'm so happy.

541
31:55.323 --> 31:57.723
You've meant more and more to me as time goes by.

542
31:59.690 --> 32:01.256
You don't need to apologize at all.

543
32:03.490 --> 32:05.098
I did it because I wanted to.

544
32:06.620 --> 32:07.640
I'm not going anywhere…

545
32:08.720 --> 32:09.890
because I love you.

546
32:12.417 --> 32:13.249
From now on,

547
32:14.844 --> 32:16.071
no matter what happens,

548
32:17.770 --> 32:19.078
I'll never give up.

549
32:20.801 --> 32:22.268
About what you asked…

550
32:24.156 --> 32:26.090
if we'll stay together forever,

551
32:28.156 --> 32:29.490
I think I can do it.

552
32:33.590 --> 32:36.256
What about you? Can you do it?

553
32:43.122 --> 32:44.456
I mean not as a friend.

554
32:53.923 --> 32:55.256
Will you be my boyfriend?

555
32:58.856 --> 32:59.656
I will, definitely.

556
34:10.616 --> 34:13.022
Surprise!

557
34:13.609 --> 34:14.776
You scared me.

558
34:15.009 --> 34:16.309
I'm happy for you, Fuse.

559
34:16.576 --> 34:18.724
Congrats.

560
34:19.752 --> 34:20.678
Tee.

561
34:20.798 --> 34:22.232
Take care of my friend.

562
34:22.807 --> 34:23.938
I'll not only take care of him.

563
34:23.963 --> 34:24.832
Huh?

564
34:25.432 --> 34:26.232
I'll have him for keeps as well.

565
34:26.324 --> 34:29.082
Ugh.

566
34:29.643 --> 34:31.398
How long are you gonna keep farming aura?

567
34:32.732 --> 34:33.532
You're farming aura too hard.

568
34:33.665 --> 34:34.165
Wit.

569
34:34.165 --> 34:34.665
Huh?

570
34:34.798 --> 34:36.198
So, is the ghost story real?

571
34:36.399 --> 34:37.132
Ah.

572
34:37.345 --> 34:38.241
The ghost story.

573
34:38.241 --> 34:38.741
Um.

574
34:39.379 --> 34:40.992
It's not real. I made it up.

575
34:41.032 --> 34:43.054
Oh.

576
34:43.146 --> 34:44.646
Hey, is it scary?

577
34:45.091 --> 34:47.825
If so, I'll share it on The Ghost Radio.

578
34:49.615 --> 34:51.345
Alright, let's take a selfie to wrap up the day.

579
34:51.370 --> 34:52.563
Com here.

580
34:52.588 --> 34:53.753
Great.

581
35:16.543 --> 35:17.343
Please have a seat.

582
35:21.976 --> 35:22.776
Wait a sec.

583
35:26.261 --> 35:28.468
Rice soup is here.

584
35:43.382 --> 35:44.616
Did you make it yourself?

585
35:44.843 --> 35:46.609
Nah, my mom made it.

586
35:46.976 --> 35:48.488
Jeez, Frame.

587
35:48.949 --> 35:51.065
But my mom's cooking is good,

588
35:51.455 --> 35:52.443
so I brought some extra for you.

589
35:52.915 --> 35:54.272
Okay.

590
35:54.676 --> 35:55.982
Let's eat at my place next time.

591
35:56.368 --> 35:56.905
Um.

592
36:08.896 --> 36:09.696
Is it tasty?

593
36:12.076 --> 36:15.142
It is, but not as tasty as you.

594
36:16.435 --> 36:17.235
Such a sweet talker.

595
36:36.043 --> 36:36.843
Hey.

596
36:37.096 --> 36:38.363
Which number is this?

597
36:39.889 --> 36:40.789
It's exactly the thousandth one.

598
36:40.942 --> 36:41.742
Really?

599
36:42.936 --> 36:44.016
Does this mean you get to make a wish now?

600
36:45.343 --> 36:46.143
Yeah.

601
36:47.542 --> 36:48.508
Not me, but you.

602
36:48.601 --> 36:50.022
What? Why?

603
36:51.536 --> 36:52.348
Well…

604
36:53.275 --> 36:54.651
The person who can make a wish…

605
36:55.338 --> 36:57.143
is the one to fold the thousandth one.

606
36:57.776 --> 36:59.102
Huh? You mean me?

607
36:59.876 --> 37:00.883
I stole it from you.

608
37:01.669 --> 37:04.389
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to steal it.

609
37:04.788 --> 37:05.643
I'm sorry.

610
37:06.922 --> 37:07.887
It's okay.

611
37:08.475 --> 37:09.475
You should make a wish.

612
37:12.675 --> 37:13.568
Well,

613
37:17.543 --> 37:18.776
I wish…

614
37:19.705 --> 37:21.384
my boyfriend could make a wish.

615
37:21.942 --> 37:23.902
See? Isn't it cool?

616
37:24.684 --> 37:27.258
So you can make a wish now.

617
37:31.187 --> 37:32.372
Um.

618
37:33.482 --> 37:34.277
Well,

619
37:36.252 --> 37:39.743
I wish my boyfriend a lot of happiness.

620
37:39.983 --> 37:41.749
Hey, why that wish?

621
37:43.343 --> 37:44.143
Because…

622
37:45.647 --> 37:46.947
if you're happy,

623
37:47.989 --> 37:48.922
I'm happy.

624
37:49.329 --> 37:50.924
Whoa.

625
37:52.143 --> 37:53.109
Such a sweet talker.

626
37:57.309 --> 37:58.109
So…

627
38:01.576 --> 38:02.376
What are you doing?

628
38:07.849 --> 38:09.649
As long as you’re here and fill my days,

629
38:09.943 --> 38:11.043
I'm more than happy.

630
38:13.742 --> 38:14.756
Hey.

631
38:15.609 --> 38:16.521
Stop it.

632
38:17.243 --> 38:18.453
We might fall.

633
38:18.453 --> 38:19.343
What's wrong with you?

634
38:20.956 --> 38:21.756
Hey.

635
38:29.502 --> 38:32.208
You're so active. You go for a run in the morning…

636
38:32.233 --> 38:34.227
and go for aerobics with me every afternoon.

637
38:35.215 --> 38:38.075
Because I want to dance with you.

638
38:38.979 --> 38:41.042
Starting tomorrow,

639
38:41.285 --> 38:42.855
I'll run with you in the morning.

640
38:42.959 --> 38:43.759
Seriously?

641
38:44.259 --> 38:45.059
Um.

642
38:45.193 --> 38:46.459
Waiting for you…

643
38:47.093 --> 38:50.738
is lonely. I might as well run with you.

644
38:51.106 --> 38:52.333
So we can stay together for a long time.

645
38:52.684 --> 38:55.585
And you won't be looking at anyone else.

646
38:55.758 --> 38:59.865
How could I look at someone else when my boyfriend is this pretty?

647
39:01.632 --> 39:04.265
Go take a shower and change your clothes.

648
39:06.593 --> 39:08.559
Why? Am I smelly?

649
39:09.145 --> 39:13.345
No, I just want to be the only one who gets to smell you like this.

650
39:14.778 --> 39:15.878
Sniff me then.

651
39:19.234 --> 39:20.180
You should go now.

652
39:20.205 --> 39:21.393
Alright, I'm leaving.

653
39:31.993 --> 39:33.359
Late and still playing around?

654
39:35.079 --> 39:37.283
I'm not playing around, just saying hi to a friend.

655
39:37.470 --> 39:38.632
Right, Locky?

656
39:46.526 --> 39:48.926
We'd better go to school or we'll be late.

657
39:53.326 --> 39:54.193
Give it to me.

658
39:56.793 --> 39:59.559
Wait, tuck your shirt in.

659
40:00.459 --> 40:01.259
At the back as well.

660
40:04.945 --> 40:06.145
You are just like my dad.

661
40:07.326 --> 40:08.659
Instead of calling you my happiness,

662
40:08.834 --> 40:10.033
can I call you Daddy?

663
40:10.058 --> 40:10.759
Hey.

664
40:11.726 --> 40:12.526
You can't.

665
40:13.359 --> 40:14.159
Why not?

666
40:14.559 --> 40:15.659
I said no.

667
40:16.726 --> 40:17.759
You can't call me like that.

668
40:18.059 --> 40:19.193
I don't understand.

669
40:20.326 --> 40:25.595
Alright, you can call me that in another three years.

670
40:25.595 --> 40:26.326
Okay?

671
40:26.993 --> 40:29.329
Okay, in another three years…

672
40:29.329 --> 40:31.659
I'll call you my Daddy.

673
40:33.031 --> 40:34.831
Fine, let's go.

674
40:43.386 --> 40:44.310
Hello.

675
40:44.335 --> 40:44.901
Hello.

676
40:44.901 --> 40:46.678
Hello.

677
40:47.000 --> 40:48.267
I’m Rodtang.

678
40:48.812 --> 40:51.545
I wonder, in the next ten years,

679
40:52.359 --> 40:53.878
what you all will be doing?

680
40:54.505 --> 40:56.805
In the next ten years? I think I would run a business.

681
40:57.572 --> 40:58.952
I want to open a pet grooming salon.

682
40:59.085 --> 41:00.780
Wow.

683
41:00.805 --> 41:01.312
That’s so sick.

684
41:01.425 --> 41:02.151
And…

685
41:03.079 --> 41:03.879
I probably take care of a kid.

686
41:04.038 --> 41:04.752
A kid? Who?

687
41:04.777 --> 41:05.277
Hey.

688
41:06.517 --> 41:07.317
Just someone around here.

689
41:11.738 --> 41:12.538
For me,

690
41:12.838 --> 41:14.405
I’ll take over the shop from my dad.

691
41:14.638 --> 41:16.205
I’ll expand my shop to ten branches.

692
41:16.591 --> 41:18.347
Wow.

693
41:18.372 --> 41:19.704
Rodtang and I will visit your shop.

694
41:19.729 --> 41:20.435
That’s cool, man.

695
41:23.131 --> 41:27.498
I want to have children in the next ten years.

696
41:27.607 --> 41:29.425
Hey.

697
41:29.450 --> 41:30.628
Having children?

698
41:30.673 --> 41:31.312
Isn’t it a bit too soon?

699
41:31.365 --> 41:36.355
I want to be a TikTok influencer.

700
41:38.127 --> 41:39.145
Reviewing some products.

701
41:39.804 --> 41:41.501
Do you think I could be an influencer?

702
41:41.639 --> 41:42.215
Absolutely.

703
41:42.215 --> 41:43.528
Of course.

704
41:46.085 --> 41:47.136
For me,

705
41:47.137 --> 41:49.137
I want to debut as a T-Pop artist.

706
41:49.137 --> 41:49.762
Really?

707
41:49.762 --> 41:50.275
Um.

708
41:50.275 --> 41:52.275
Can I be your very first fan?

709
41:54.782 --> 41:55.978
When my song goes viral…

710
41:56.533 --> 41:58.033
and people use it for aerobics,

711
41:58.275 --> 41:59.292
let’s dance together.

712
41:59.292 --> 41:59.875
Sure.

713
42:00.276 --> 42:01.933
Whoa.

714
42:01.933 --> 42:03.173
So sweet.

715
42:04.001 --> 42:06.601
I might take a scholarship exam to study abroad.

716
42:06.647 --> 42:07.947
Hey, what about me?

717
42:08.914 --> 42:09.714
Can I go with you?

718
42:11.944 --> 42:13.187
You can’t.

719
42:14.127 --> 42:14.712
You’re dumb.

720
42:18.795 --> 42:20.408
I’m going to study hard right now.

721
42:21.375 --> 42:22.175
I hope you mean it.

722
42:22.608 --> 42:23.441
For me,

723
42:25.075 --> 42:26.741
I want to be a reporter.

724
42:26.741 --> 42:27.121
Why?

725
42:27.146 --> 42:28.713
Because I’m nosy.

726
42:30.128 --> 42:32.503
Being nosy.

727
42:33.608 --> 42:34.975
That’s suit you.

728
42:37.281 --> 42:38.415
Ten years from now on?

729
42:39.780 --> 42:41.647
By then, I probably have graduated.

730
42:42.265 --> 42:45.177
Started working and moved in with my boyfriend.

731
42:48.348 --> 42:51.415
We’ll see each other in the evenings and go out together on weekends.

732
42:56.275 --> 42:58.969
By that time, I’ll probably keep walking.

733
42:59.703 --> 43:00.828
Where to?

734
43:02.641 --> 43:03.601
Just keep walking forward,

735
43:04.225 --> 43:07.380
towards my future and my love.

736
43:11.261 --> 43:12.581
I guess I’ll just keep walking…

737
43:13.032 --> 43:15.355
alongside this four-eyes next to me.

738
43:15.734 --> 43:18.676
Gosh, that’s so cute.

739
43:19.564 --> 43:21.972
Can you stop recording? I’m gonna kiss my boyfriend.

740
43:23.675 --> 43:24.941
Okay, sure.

741
43:25.747 --> 43:28.347
See you again in ten years.

742
43:29.080 --> 43:29.985
See you.

743
43:30.017 --> 43:32.458
Bye bye.

744
43:34.370 --> 43:35.116
Hey.

745
43:35.141 --> 43:36.894
Go, let’s go.
